%% Money flow for one offering. Ramps are planned (SCF roadmap), not integrated on testnet.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Inv as Investor
  participant Ramp as On/off-ramps (planned)<br/>CCTP · Bridge · Koywe
  participant OC as Offering contract
  participant SPV as SPV treasury
  actor Exp as Exporter
  actor Buy as Buyer / insurer

  Inv->>Ramp: Fiat (Bridge, Koywe) or USDC on another chain (CCTP)
  Ramp-->>Inv: USDC on Stellar
  Inv->>OC: subscribe: USDC into escrow
  OC-->>Inv: shares minted in the same transaction
  OC->>SPV: fund: escrow released once the cap is reached
  SPV->>Ramp: USDC out
  Ramp->>Exp: Exporter paid in local currency (existing payout flow)
  Note over Exp,Buy: Shipment delivered, 90 to 120 days
  Buy->>Ramp: Buyer pays (or insurer pays the claim)
  Ramp-->>SPV: USDC on Stellar
  SPV->>OC: deposit_distribution: collected amount + outcome code
  Inv->>OC: redeem
  OC-->>Inv: pro-rata share of what was collected, up to the fixed amount set in the offering terms, shares burned
  OC->>SPV: sweep_surplus: any amount above what investors are owed
